 data-en=\"Responsibilities\" data-fr=\"Contributions\">Responsibilities</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-secondary\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"flex gap-3\">Preparing and integrating 3D assets into web and Unity applications.</li><li class=\"flex gap-3\">Building immersive interactions and intuitive spatial navigation.</li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"eyebrow mb-3\" data-en=\"Problem it solves\" data-fr=\"Le problème traité\">Problem it solves</h4><p class=\"text-secondary\">Static representations that make it difficult to understand space, state or an interactive experience.</p></div></div></details></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"philosophy\" data-section=\"Philosophy\" class=\"border-t border-white/10 py-28 md:py-40\" aria-labelledby=\"philosophy-title\"><div class=\"container-x\"><div class=\"mb-16 md:mb-24\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand-400\">04</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Development philosophy</p><h2 class=\"display-h2 max-w-5xl [text-wrap:balance]\"><span id=\"philosophy-title\" data-en=\"How I think about building useful systems.\" data-fr=\"Ma façon de concevoir des systèmes utiles.\">How I think about building useful systems.</span></h2></div><ol role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.025] md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline md:gap-8 md:py-12\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-400 md:col-span-1\">01</span><h3 class=\"display-h3 md:col-span-5\" data-en=\"Think in systems\" data-fr=\"Penser en systèmes\">Think in systems</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary md:col-span-6\">Understand the full path: the physical source, the data exchange, the backend service and the interface that makes the result useful.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.025] md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline md:gap-8 md:py-12\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-400 md:col-span-1\">02</span><h3 class=\"display-h3 md:col-span-5\" data-en=\"Make the complex readable\" data-fr=\"Rendre le complexe lisible\">Make the complex readable</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary md:col-span-6\">Turn technical complexity into interfaces that are clear to navigate, whether the screen is a dashboard, a 3D scene or a VR environment.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.025] md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline md:gap-8 md:py-12\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-400 md:col-span-1\">03</span><h3 class=\"display-h3 md:col-span-5\" data-en=\"Build for real-time behavior\" data-fr=\"Concevoir pour le temps réel\">Build for real-time behavior</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary md:col-span-6\">Pay attention to state, asynchronous communication and the performance of each part of the application.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"group grid gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-9 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.025] md:grid-cols-12 md:items-baseline md:gap-8 md:py-12\"><span class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-400 md:col-span-1\">04</span><h3 class=\"display-h3 md:col-span-5\" data-en=\"Keep the next developer in mind\" data-fr=\"Penser au prochain développeur\">Keep the next developer in mind</h3><p class=\"max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary md:col-span-6\">Favor modular architecture, explicit API contracts and technical documentation that makes the project easier to maintain.</p></div></div></li></ol></div></section><section id=\"ecosystem\