/span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Experience snapshot</p><h2 class=\"display-h2 max-w-5xl [text-wrap:balance]\"><span id=\"exp-title\" data-en=\"From web interfaces to connected worlds.\" data-fr=\"Des interfaces web aux mondes connectés.\">From web interfaces to connected worlds.</span></h2></div><ol role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"grid gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-9 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8 md:py-11\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist md:col-span-3\">2026</p><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">DICE / UM6P</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-secondary\">Software Engineer · Digital Twin &amp; Real-Time Systems</p></div><p class=\"max-w-xl text-secondary md:col-span-5\">Designed a distributed digital-twin architecture with Python/FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka, MQTT and WebSocket/GraphQL APIs, alongside Unity supervision interfaces.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"grid gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-9 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8 md:py-11\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist md:col-span-3\">January 2026</p><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Al-Moftah Real Estate</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-secondary\">Full-Stack · 3D &amp; VR Developer</p></div><p class=\"max-w-xl text-secondary md:col-span-5\">Built an interactive full-stack property platform with web interfaces, business data and backend services. Integrated 3D / WebXR and contributed to cloud deployment, with GitHub CI/CD and asset delivery workflows.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"grid gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-9 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8 md:py-11\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist md:col-span-3\">August 2023</p><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">UM6P Vanguard Center</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-secondary\">XR / AI Developer</p></div><p class=\"max-w-xl text-secondary md:col-span-5\">Built a real-time body-tracking pipeline with Python and MediaPipe, transmitting motion data over WebSocket to Unity.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"\"><div class=\"grid gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-9 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8 md:py-11\"><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-mist md:col-span-3\">August 2021</p><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">SEOCOM</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-secondary\">Full-Stack Developer</p></div><p class=\"max-w-xl text-secondary md:col-span-5\">Built PHP / JavaScript / MySQL applications and MVC / REST APIs. Used Git branching, Linux server deployment and basic update automation, with monitoring, logging and query / load optimization.</p></div></div></li></ol><div class=\"mt-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-10\"><a class=\"cursor-target group inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-base font-medium text-paper \" href=\"#full-timeline\"><span class=\"uv-link pb-0.5\" data-en=\"Read the full timeline\" data-fr=\"Lire le parcours complet\">Read the full timeline</span><span class=\"uv-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m0 0-7-7m7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><details id=\"full-timeline\" class=\"full-timeline\"><summary><span data-en=\"Full professional timeline\" data-fr=\"Parcours professionnel complet\">Full professional timeline</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"timeline-content\"><p class=\"timeline-intro\" data-en=\"The responsibilities, technical choices and delivery work behind each experience.\" data-fr=\"Les responsabilités, choix techniques et travaux de livraison derrière chaque expérience.\">The responsibilities, technical choices and delivery work behind each experience.</p><ol class=\"timeline-entries\"><li class=\"timeline-entry\"><div class=\"timeline-meta\"><p data-en=\"2026\" data-fr=\"2026\">2026</p><p data-en=\"Benguerir, Morocco\" data-fr=\"Benguerir, Maroc\">Benguerir, Morocco</p></div><div><h3>DICE / UM6P</h3><p class=\"timeline-role\" data-en=\"Software Engineer · Backend &amp; Distributed Systems\" data-fr=\"Ingénieur logiciel · Backend &amp; systèmes distribués\">Software Engineer · Backend &amp; Distributed Systems</p><p class=\"timeline-context\" data-en=\"Final-year engineering project: a distributed digital-twin platform connecting backend services, live data and supervision interfaces.\" data-fr=\"Projet de fin d’études : une plateforme distribuée de jumeau numérique reliant services backend, données temps réel et interfaces de supervision.\">Final-year engineering project: a distributed digital-twin platform connecting backend services, live data and supervision interfaces.</p><ul class=\"timeline-contributions\"><li data-en=\"Designed the architecture connecting backend services, databases, APIs and the virtual supervision environment.\" data-fr=\"Conception de l’architecture reliant services backend, bases de données, APIs et environnement virtuel de supervision.\">Designed the architecture connecting backend services, databases, APIs and the virtual supervision environment.</li><li data-en=\"Developed Python / FastAPI services integrating PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka and MQTT.\" data-fr=\"Développement de services Python / FastAPI intégrant PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka et MQTT.\">Developed Python / FastAPI services integrating PostgreSQL, Redis, Kafka and MQTT.</li><li data-en=\"Connected asynchronous data flows through GraphQL and WebSocket interfaces, with attention to reliable and consistent state.\" data-fr=\"Connexion des flux asynchrones via GraphQL et WebSocket, avec une attention portée à la fiabilité et à la cohérence des états.\">Connected asynchronous data flows through GraphQL and WebSocket interfaces, with attention to reliable and consistent state.</li><li data-en=\"Mapped physical zones to virtual entities and integrated Unity supervision, with technical documentation and a modular project structure.\" data-fr=\"Correspondance entre zones physiques et entités virtuelles, intégration de la supervision Unity, documentation technique et structure modulaire du projet.\">Mapped physical zones to virtual entities and integrated Unity supervision, with technical documentation and a modular project structure.</li></ul><div class=\"timeline-stack\"><span>Python</span><span>FastAPI</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Redis</span><span>Kafka</span><span>MQTT</span><span>GraphQL</span><span>WebSocket</span><span>Unity</span></div><a href=\"#project-twin\" data-project=\"twin\" class=\"timeline-project\" data-en=\"Explore the related work ↗\" data-fr=\"Explorer le projet associé ↗\">Explore the related work ↗</a></div></li><li class=\"timeline-entry\"><div class=\"timeline-meta\"><p data-en=\"January 2026\" data-fr=\"Janvier 2026\">January 2026</p><p data-en=\"Muscat, Oman\" data-fr=\"Mascate, Oman\">Muscat, Oman</p></div><div><h3>Al-Moftah Real Estate</h3><p class=\"timeline-role\" data-en=\"Full-Stack · 3D &amp; VR Developer\" data-fr=\"Développeur full stack · 3D &amp; VR\">Full-Stack · 3D &amp; VR Developer</p><p class=\"timeline-context\" data-en=\"An interactive property platform bringing web interfaces, business information and immersive visualization into the same application.\" data-fr=\"Une plateforme immobilière interactive associant interfaces web, informations métier et visualisation immersive dans une même application.\">An interactive property platform bringing web interfaces, business information and immersive visualization into the same application.</p><ul class=\"timeline-contributions\"><li data-en=\"Developed frontend interfaces, application logic and business-data integration with backend services.\" data-fr=\"Développement des interfaces frontend, de la logique applicative et de l’intégration des données métier aux services backend.\">Developed frontend interfaces, application logic and business-data integration with backend services.</li><li data-en=\"Integrated Three.js / WebGL and VR / WebXR property exploration.\" data-fr=\"Intégration de l’exploration immobilière Three.js / WebGL et VR / WebXR.\">Integrated Three.js / WebGL and VR / WebXR property exploration.</li><li data-en=\"Prepared and integrated Blender / glTF assets, with dynamic loading and build / asset delivery optimization.\" data-fr=\"Préparation et intégration des assets Blender / glTF, chargement dynamique et optimisation des builds et de la livraison des assets.\">Prepared and integrated Blender / glTF assets, with dynamic loading and build / asset delivery optimization.</li><li data-en=\"Contributed to cloud integration and deployment, with GitHub CI/CD workflows.\" data-fr=\"Contribution à l’intégration et au déploiement Cloud, avec des workflows GitHub CI/CD.\">Contributed to cloud integration and deployment, with GitHub CI/CD workflows.</li></ul><div class=\"timeline-stack\"><span>React</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Three.js</span><span>WebGL</span><span>WebXR</span><span>Blender / glTF</span><span>GitHub CI/CD</span><span>Cloud deployment</span></div><a href=\"#project-keyone\" data-project=\"keyone\" class=\"timeline-project\" data-en=\"Explore the related work ↗\" data-fr=\"Explorer le projet associé ↗\">Explore the related work ↗</a></div></li><li class=\"timeline-entry\"><div class=\"timeline-meta\"><p data-en=\"August 2023\" data-fr=\"Août 2023\">August 2023</p><p data-en=\"Benguerir, Morocco\" data-fr=\"Benguerir, Maroc\">Benguerir, Morocco</p></div><div><h3>UM6P Vanguard Center</h3><p class=\"timeline-role\" data-en=\"XR / AI Developer\" data-fr=\"Développeur XR / IA\">XR / AI Developer</p><p class=\"timeline-context\" data-en=\"A real-time computer-vision pipeline connecting a camera feed to an interactive Unity WebGL application.\" data-fr=\"Un pipeline de vision par ordinateur temps réel reliant une caméra à une application Unity WebGL interactive.\">A real-time computer-vision pipeline connecting a camera feed to an interactive Unity WebGL application.</p><ul class=\"timeline-contributions\"><li data-en=\"Processed pose and body-tracking data using Python and MediaPipe.\" data-fr=\"Traitement des données de pose et de suivi corporel avec Python et MediaPipe.\">Processed pose and body-tracking data using Python and MediaPipe.</li><li data-en=\"Transmitted continuous tracking data through Node.js / WebSocket to Unity, with normalization and filtering.\" data-fr=\"Transmission des données continues via Node.js / WebSocket vers Unity, avec normalisation et filtrage.\">Transmitted continuous tracking data through Node.js / WebSocket to Unity, with normalization and filtering.</li><li data-en=\"Structured the integration as a modular event-driven system and optimized Unity WebGL rendering.\" data-fr=\"Structuration de l’intégration en système modulaire événementiel et optimisation du rendu Unity WebGL.\">Structured the integration as a modular event-driven system and optimized Unity WebGL rendering.</li><li data-en=\"Deployed the application to UM6P’s cloud for internal testing.\" data-fr=\"Déploiement de l’application dans le Cloud de l’UM6P pour des tests internes.\">Deployed the application to UM6P’s cloud for internal testing.</li></ul><div class=\"timeline-stack\"><span>Python</span><span>MediaPipe</span><span>Node.js</span><span>WebSocket</span><span>Unity</span><span>C#</span><span>WebGL</span></div><a href=\"#project-pose\" data-project=\"pose\" class=\"timeline-project\" data-en=\"Explore the related work ↗\" data-fr=\"Explorer le projet associé ↗\">Explore the related work ↗</a></div></li><li class=\"timeline-entry\"><div class=\"timeline-meta\"><p data-en=\"August 2021\" data-fr=\"Août 2021\">August 2021</p><p data-en=\"Marrakech, Morocco\" data-fr=\"Marrakech, Maroc\">Marrakech, Morocco</p></div><div><h3>SEOCOM</h3><p class=\"timeline-role\" data-en=\"Full-Stack Developer\" data-fr=\"Développeur full stack\">Full-Stack Developer</p><p class=\"timeline-context\" data-en=\"Full-stack web development together with the practical work of deploying, maintaining and monitoring applications.\" data-fr=\"Développement web full stack associé au déploiement, à la maintenance et à la supervision des applications.\">Full-stack web development together with the practical work of deploying, maintaining and monitoring applications.</p><ul class=\"timeline-contributions\"><li data-en=\"Built PHP / JavaScript / MySQL web applications and structured REST APIs using an MVC architecture.\" data-fr=\"Développement d’applications web PHP / JavaScript / MySQL et d’APIs REST structurées selon une architecture MVC.\">Built PHP / JavaScript / MySQL web applications and structured REST APIs using an MVC architecture.</li><li data-en=\"Optimized SQL queries, backend data handling and lightweight processing pipelines.\" data-fr=\"Optimisation des requêtes SQL, du traitement backend et de pipelines de données légers.\">Optimized SQL queries, backend data handling and lightweight processing pipelines.</li><li data-en=\"Used Git branching, Linux server deployment and basic update automation.\" data-fr=\"Utilisation des branches Git, du déploiement sur serveurs Linux et d’une automatisation simple des mises à jour.\">Used Git branching, Linux server deployment and basic update automation.</li><li data-en=\"Worked on application reliability through monitoring, logging and load optimization.\" data-fr=\"Amélioration de la fiabilité via la supervision, les logs et l’optimisation de charge.\">Worked on application reliability through monitoring, logging and load optimization.</li></ul><div class=\"timeline-stack\"><span>PHP</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>MySQL</span><span>REST</span><span>MVC</span><span>Git</span><span>Linux</span><span>Logging / monitoring</span></div><a href=\"#project-delivery\" data-project=\"delivery\" class=\"timeline-project\" data-en=\"Explore the related work ↗\" data-fr=\"Explorer le projet associé ↗\">Explore the related work ↗</a></div></li></ol><a href=\"/cv/Yassir-Aitali-Software-Engineer.pdf\" download=\"\" class=\"timeline-project\" data-en=\"Download the software engineering CV ↗\" data-fr=\"Télécharger le CV ingénieur logiciel ↗\">Download the software engineering CV ↗</a></div></details></div></section><section id=\"process\" data-section=\"Process\" class=\"border-t border-white/10 py-28 md:py-40\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\"><div class=\"container-x\"><div class=\"mb-20\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand-400\">08</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>How I build products</p><h2 class=\"display-h2 max-w-5xl [text-wrap:balance]\"><span id=\"process-title\">A repeatable path from brief to shipped feature.</span></h2></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-[0.45rem] top-2 bottom-2 w-px bg-white/10 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"w-full bg-brand-500 transition-[height] duration-1000 ease-[var(--ease-out-expo)]\" style=\"height:0%\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-[0.45rem] hidden h-px bg-white/10 lg:block\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full bg-brand-500 transition-[width] duration-1000 ease-[var(--ease-out-expo)]\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><ol class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"relative pl-8 lg:pl-0 lg:pt-10\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-3 rounded-full border transition-colors duration-700 lg:top-0 border-white/30 bg-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-mist\">01</p><h3 class=\"display-h3 mt-3 !text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2rem)]\">Understand</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-secondary\">Start with the user, the system constraints and the data the application needs.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 lg:pl-0 lg:pt-10\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-3 rounded-full border transition-colors duration-700 lg:top-0 border-white/30 bg-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-mist\">02</p><h3 class=\"display-h3 mt-3 !text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2rem)]\">Structure</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-secondary\">Define the architecture, interfaces, assets and communication between components.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 lg:pl-0 lg:pt-10\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-3 rounded-full border transition-colors duration-700 lg:top-0 border-white/30 bg-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-mist\">03</p><h3 class=\"display-h3 mt-3 !text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2rem)]\">Build</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-secondary\">Develop the backend, frontend or immersive interaction in focused, modular pieces.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 lg:pl-0 lg:pt-10\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-3 rounded-full border transition-colors duration-700 lg:top-0 border-white/30 bg-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-mist\">04</p><h3 class=\"display-h3 mt-3 !text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2rem)]\">Connect</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-secondary\">Integrate APIs, data streams and 3D assets into one coherent experience.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 lg:pl-0 lg:pt-10\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1 size-3 rounded-full border transition-colors duration-700 lg:top-0 border-white/30 bg-ink\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-mist\">05</p><h3 class=\"display-h3 mt-3 !text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.2vw,2rem)]\">Verify &amp; refine</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-secondary\">Review behavior, performance and clarity, then improve the details that matter.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section id=\"now\" data-section=\"Current focus\" class=\"border-t border-white/10 py-28 md:py-40\" aria-labelledby=\"now-title\"><div class=\"container-x grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-4\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand-400\">09</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Current focus</p></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-8\"><h2 id=\"now-title\" class=\"display-h2 [text-wrap:balance]\" data-en=\"AI engineering, full-stack systems and DevOps.\" data-fr=\"Ingénierie IA, systèmes full stack et DevOps.\">AI engineering, full-stack systems and DevOps.</h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-secondary\" data-en=\"I’m an EMSI engineering graduate with specialized VR training at UM6P. I’m interested in AI engineering, full-stack, backend and DevOps opportunities. I bring practical computer-vision integration, real-time pipelines and distributed-system experience, alongside document-intelligence / RAG exploration.\" data-fr=\"Ingénieur diplômé de l’EMSI et formé au développement VR à l’UM6P, je recherche des opportunités en ingénierie IA, full stack, backend et DevOps. J’apporte une expérience pratique en vision par ordinateur, pipelines temps réel et systèmes distribués, ainsi que des explorations d’intelligence documentaire / RAG.\">I’m an EMSI engineering graduate with specialized VR training at UM6P. I’m interested in AI engineering, full-stack, backend and DevOps opportunities. I bring practical computer-vision integration, real-time pipelines and distributed-system experience, alongside document-intelligence / RAG exploration.</p><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow mb-2\">Profile</p><p>AI &amp; Software Engineer</p></div><div><p class=\"eyebrow mb-2\">Engineering degree</p><p>EMSI · 2026</p></div><div><p class=\"eyebrow mb-2\">Based in</p><p>Marrakech, Morocco</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"cursor-target group inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-base font-medium text-paper \" href=\"#full-timeline\"><span class=\"uv-link pb-0.5\" data-en=\"See where I’ve been\" data-fr=\"Voir mon parcours\">See where I’ve been</span><span class=\"uv-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m0 0-7-7m7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div id=\"resume\" class=\"reference-resume\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow mb-3\">CV / Education</p><h3 class=\"display-h3\">Two perspectives. One profile.</h3><p class=\"text-secondary mt-4\">Software engineering · EMSI, 2026<br>VR development · IDC / UM6P, 2023<br>BTS Multimedia &amp; Web Design, 2022</p></div><div class=\"resume-links\"><a href=\"/cv/Yassir-Aitali-Software-Engineer.pdf\" download><span>Software Engineer<small>Backend, distributed systems &amp; real-time · PDF / FR</small></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/cv/Yassir-Aitali-XR-Engineer.pdf\" download><span>Unity / XR Developer<small>3D, VR &amp; immersive applications · PDF / FR</small></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"why\" data-section=\"Why work with me\" class=\"border-t border-white/10 py-28 md:py-40\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\"><div class=\"container-x\"><div class=\"mb-16\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-brand-400\">10</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/25\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Why work with me</p><h2 class=\"display-h2 max-w-5xl [text-wrap:balance]\"><span id=\"why-title\" data-en=\"What you can count on.\" data-fr=\"Ce que je peux apporter.\">What you can count on.</span></h2></div><dl class=\"grid gap-x-16 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-6\"><dt class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Systems perspective<span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-normal text-brand-400\">01</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg pl-9 text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary\">From data pipelines and APIs to the screen or 3D environment, I understand how the parts connect.</dd></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-6\"><dt class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Delivery matters<span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-normal text-brand-400\">02</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg pl-9 text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary\">I connect development with Git workflows, Linux deployment, cloud integration and reproducible Docker environments.</dd></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-6\"><dt class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Hands-on across the stack<span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-normal text-brand-400\">03</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg pl-9 text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary\">Java / OOP, Spring Cloud, Python / FastAPI, React / TypeScript and real-time application integration.</dd></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-6\"><dt class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">AI connected to software<span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-normal text-brand-400\">04</span></dt><dd class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg pl-9 text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary\">Body tracking and smart parking connect computer vision to live applications; document intelligence / RAG is my current AI exploration.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section id=\"contact-cta\" data-section=\"Let’s talk\" class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 py-32 md:py-48\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(55%_60%_at_50%_100%,rgba(255,91,46,0.16),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"container-x text-center\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-8\">11 · Let’s talk</p><h2 id=\"cta-title\" class=\"display-h1 mx-auto max-w-6xl [text-wrap:balance]\">Let’s build something <span class=\"text-brand-400\">useful</span>.</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg text-sec